REMOVED: |dTI| Mismatch (abs_dTI) -- DEPLOYMENT CONSTRAINT
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
gamma was: 0.055 +/- 0.039, Multiplier: 1.06x per +1 SD

Formula: |TI_WTG - TI_MM|
Reason for removal:
    TI at the WTG location is NEVER available during deployment — only the
    predictor mast (MM) has measurements. Therefore |dTI| cannot be computed
    for new projects. TI_MM is kept because it only requires MM-site data.


